      "message": "Answer my own question ^^\nThe first tcpm_init() (before the while loop in pd_task()) will keep looping since TCPC is not powered up. After plug and 7688 being powered up, it returns from tcpm_init() and completes this function. There is another tcpm_init() later due to TCPC reset. \n\nLooks like the 500ms delay is not required at all since TCPC will inform TCPM after it is ready.",
